    "caption": "The Severed, Considered. Spacious slow instrumental for deliberate repair planning in a silent quarry. A low bowed analogue synth gives D G F E D over a D minor drone; distant glass answers only at the ends of long phrases. A muted frame drum touches the first beat of alternating bars. The middle opens toward a suspended A and thins down, low unresolved D as the opening returns. Dark, careful, still kind. Restrained early PC game synth scoring in a wide modern mix. No heavy accent, sudden peak, accelerando, combat groove, voices or triumphant release.",
